WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.160
It was different this time because
I kind of felt the fabric.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.520
I understood that there was a lot of work.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.320
You know, when you see fabrics,
normally people bring them for you.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.040
You kind of see them as,
it’s more of,

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.160
“Okay, I can just remove these patterns.”

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.400
There are no emotions that go into place.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.280
But with this, I feel like
I had to put in emotions.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.080
I had to put in so much work
to make sure that,

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.600
you know, I brought out the fabrics.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.760
Now I see fabrics differently.
